Why did you lie to me?

00:42:11.100 --> 00:42:15.580
I'm Yen Tien-shim. I've never lost my life.

00:42:15.580 --> 00:42:18.410
I met Master Wong today.

00:42:19.020 --> 00:42:21.240
Even if I have to apologize, I have to do it once.

00:42:22.800 --> 00:42:26.720
So you're Yen Tien-shim, the cold-blooded killer

00:42:26.720 --> 00:42:26.940
who's been talking about the world.

00:42:27.740 --> 00:42:29.610
That's right.

00:42:30.440 --> 00:42:34.660
If you meet me, I'm afraid I won't trust him so much.

00:42:35.200 --> 00:42:38.280
Then you must be a good man, Mr. Huang.

00:42:38.750 --> 00:42:59.680
You two...

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:00.300
30 minutes!

00:43:00.360 --> 00:43:01.640
3 minutes!

00:43:13.110 --> 00:43:13.710
107 minutes!

00:44:13.240 --> 00:44:13.420
Master!

00:44:13.880 --> 00:44:15.360
Dad, you're not going to die, are you?

00:44:15.420 --> 00:44:17.460
You bastard, you're back!

00:44:18.420 --> 00:44:19.780
Dad, don't be afraid.

00:44:19.840 --> 00:44:20.730
If you're afraid, you'll have your share.

00:44:20.950 --> 00:44:22.520
Who dares to scare my dad?

00:44:22.700 --> 00:44:24.020
Let me give him a share.

00:44:24.300 --> 00:44:28.420
If you're afraid, you'll have your share.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:34.470
So it's you who came back to pay your father a visit.

00:44:35.350 --> 00:44:36.400
You...

00:44:37.000 --> 00:44:40.160
Mr. Wong, if you give birth to this boy,

00:44:40.300 --> 00:44:41.220
you'll have to pay for the rest of your life.

00:44:43.900 --> 00:44:45.460
There's no point in giving birth to a child.

00:44:47.240 --> 00:44:48.570
You're a good boy.

00:44:48.650 --> 00:44:50.140
Go back and pick up the pigs.

00:44:50.420 --> 00:44:52.540
Or you'll be fired too.

00:44:53.400 --> 00:44:54.280
I won't pick up the pigs.

00:44:54.360 --> 00:44:55.440
I'll pick them up for you.

00:44:55.620 --> 00:44:58.130
I'll be more generous.

00:44:58.330 --> 00:44:59.980
I'll buy you a meal today.

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:01.040
I'll see you off tomorrow.

00:45:09.720 --> 00:45:13.650
Master, what brings you here?

00:45:14.200 --> 00:45:17.420
How can I miss the show?

00:45:18.680 --> 00:45:21.630
It's none of your business.

00:45:22.590 --> 00:45:24.850
Then you're wrong.

00:45:25.610 --> 00:45:28.620
I'm here for the show.

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:32.340
You don't have to be afraid, I'll deal with you myself.

00:45:34.500 --> 00:45:36.680
He'll deal with you himself.

00:48:09.340 --> 00:48:11.010
I am Satsang! I am Satsang!

00:48:30.730 --> 00:48:35.410
Dantai, Jingzhou, Lanyu, Po, Han, Zhongli,

00:48:36.120 --> 00:48:58.160
Diebo, Pucheng, Gou, Shending, Lv, Ma, Shi,

00:49:01.210 --> 00:49:02.570
I still have a few more things to do.

00:49:02.940 --> 00:49:04.760
I'm going to kill you!

00:49:04.900 --> 00:49:11.450
I'm going to kill you!

00:49:40.330 --> 00:49:40.490
What's the matter?

00:49:42.400 --> 00:49:43.660
You're still angry?

00:49:44.120 --> 00:49:46.210
I'm more angry than a dog!

00:49:46.310 --> 00:49:48.560
I'm stronger than a dog!

00:49:48.680 --> 00:49:50.010
I'm stronger than a dog!

00:50:14.080 --> 00:50:14.440
What the hell are you doing?

00:50:32.480 --> 00:50:33.260
For...

00:50:44.650 --> 00:50:45.190
Nim's sorrow!

00:51:03.130 --> 00:51:04.490
And you can also play the harmony!

00:51:06.390 --> 00:51:11.740
Harmony! Harmony! Harmony!

00:51:13.510 --> 00:51:20.700
What will you do? I haven't learned it yet.

00:51:20.820 --> 00:51:23.960
Can you teach me?

00:51:55.120 --> 00:51:57.730
lf you want to kill me, you'll have to kill me first.

00:52:00.730 --> 00:52:01.810
Let's start from the beginning.

00:52:02.250 --> 00:52:03.670
Let's start from the beginning.

00:52:04.570 --> 00:52:23.940
Let's start from the beginning.

00:52:33.710 --> 00:52:42.690
It's so beautiful

00:53:02.240 --> 00:53:09.150
Every master, every Buddha, every horse, every Buddha, every temple, every bodhisattva and every master have different ways of playing the Buddha.

00:54:02.620 --> 00:54:02.800
Hmm.

00:54:33.450 --> 00:54:33.550
We'll be right back.
